{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55665","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 六十三 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 六十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清平大业行皆奢，岂独尧时听所加。\n丰俭由人天不远，安危在智道非赊。\n关津防害反爲害，法令除邪却长邪。\n争似无言敷密化，既能成国又成家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55665.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55665","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}